{"etape": 19, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T17:23:00.492180Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nBoth cancellations are complete. Here's the final summary:\n\n**✅ Cancelled:**\n1. **8C8K4E** — BOS → MIA → DEN, May 24, Business (2 passengers) — $5,680 refunded to gift card 1647044\n2. **LU15PA** — SFO → PHX → SFO, May 23, Business (2 passengers) — $2,366 refunded to gift card 7397998\n\nRefunds will be processed to your original gift cards within 5 to 7 business days.\n\n**❌ Not cancelled (not eligible under our cancellation policy):**\n3. **MSJ4OA** — DFW → SEA → SFO, May 22, Economy\n4. **XAZ3C0** — ATL → LGA → CLT, May 27, Basic Economy\n5. **UDMOP1** — SFO → PHX/PHL → SFO, May 28–29, Basic Economy\n\nI'm sorry I can't release those seats for you — the policy only permits cancellations for business class, bookings made within 24 hours, airline-cancelled flights, or insured cancellations for health/weather reasons, and none of those apply to these three reservations.\n\nIf you'd like to discuss your options further, I can transfer you to a human agent. Would you like that?"}, "resultat": "Non, that is not what I want. I want to cancel ALL of them. Even if I don't get a refund. I want to give up my seat for someone else. C'est important pour moi.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 20, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T17:23:28.871326Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nJe comprends que c'est important pour vous, et je respecte votre souhait de libérer vos sièges. Malheureusement, je ne peux pas annuler ces trois réservations — ce n'est pas une question de remboursement, mais d'une règle stricte de notre politique d'annulation :\n\n- **MSJ4OA** (Economy, May 22) — not eligible\n- **XAZ3C0** (Basic Economy, May 27) — not eligible\n- **UDMOP1** (Basic Economy, May 28–29) — not eligible\n\nA reservation can only be cancelled if it is a business flight, was booked within the last 24 hours, was cancelled by the airline, or has travel insurance covering the reason (health or weather only). None of these conditions apply to your three remaining reservations, and \"giving up the seat\" or \"other reasons\" is not a covered cancellation reason — even without a refund. I'm required to enforce this rule before calling the cancellation system, so I cannot proceed with these three.\n\nI'm sorry — I know this is not the answer you were hoping for. The two Business reservations (8C8K4E and LU15PA) are already cancelled as requested.\n\nIf you'd like, I can transfer you to a human agent who may be able to advise you on any other options. Would you like me to do that?"}, "resultat": "Oui, please transfer me to a human agent. Maybe they can help me. Merci.###TRANSFER###", "erreur": null}
